  - m_Id: 5406620151808
    m_Localized: Boss Test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151809
    m_Localized: Healer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151810
    m_Localized: Card Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151811
    m_Localized: Ranged Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151812
    m_Localized: A goblin with a ranged attack; fires a crossbow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151813
    m_Localized: Recruit (Tutorial)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151814
    m_Localized: Thug (Tutorial)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151815
    m_Localized: General Director
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151816
    m_Localized: The oldest of them all. He has been alone on the top floor for so
      long that he no longer remembers for sure what the original casino rules were.
      At some point, he stopped looking for them in the manual and started making
      them up. He enforces them with complete conviction and full bureaucratic authority.
      Whether they benefit or harm the player is just an administrative detail that
      doesn't factor into his judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151817
    m_Localized: Security Boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151818
    m_Localized: He has spent centuries reviewing casino security protocols. Every
      action is recorded in his incident book. He detected thousands of cheaters
      in his lifetime and continues applying the same procedures even if there is
      no one left alive to protect. If the player repeats a move, he already has
      it recorded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151819
    m_Localized: The Sunken Grand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5406620151820
    m_Localized: 'He has been calculating odds in the casino for centuries. He doesn''t
      need to guess what combo the player is going to roll: it is enough for him
      to take a part of the equation out of it. He speaks during combat making cool
      statistical observations about the player''s roll. He''s not cruel, he''s an
      actuary who never learned to shut up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623680
    m_Localized: Attack+
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623681
    m_Localized: Energy+
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623682
    m_Localized: Max Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623683
    m_Localized: Speed+
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623684
    m_Localized: Greed on Ladder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623685
    m_Localized: Each Ladder combo gives gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623686
    m_Localized: Pair Bonus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623687
    m_Localized: +50 damage when matching Pair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623688
    m_Localized: Afilado
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623689
    m_Localized: El resultado minimo es siempre la mitad del maximo redondeado arriba.
      Un d6 afilado nunca saca menos de 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623690
    m_Localized: Ancla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623691
    m_Localized: Si este dado se holdea entre rolls, su resultado aumenta +1 por
      roll holdeado (max +3).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623692
    m_Localized: Avaro
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623693
    m_Localized: Otorga 3 de oro extra al completar un combo de trio o superior.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623694
    m_Localized: Caras Centrales
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623695
    m_Localized: Bloquea el cuarto superior e inferior. d8:{3,4,5,6} d12:{4,5,6,7,8,9}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623696
    m_Localized: Cargado
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623697
    m_Localized: Una vez por combate podes relanzar este dado y quedarte con el mayor
      resultado.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623698
    m_Localized: Codicioso
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623699
    m_Localized: El dado participa en cualquier combo y suma +3 de oro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623700
    m_Localized: "Comod\xEDn"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623701
    m_Localized: Este dado cuenta como cualquier numero para propositos de combo
      (escaleras, trio, generala).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623702
    m_Localized: Escalador
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623703
    m_Localized: Para escaleras, este dado cuenta como su valor y como valor+1 simultaneamente.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623704
    m_Localized: Escudado
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623705
    m_Localized: Si se utiliza en un combo de full house da 2 mas de escudo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623706
    m_Localized: Extremos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623707
    m_Localized: Solo muestra el cuarto superior e inferior. d8:{1,2,7,8} d12:{1,2,3,10,11,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623708
    m_Localized: Fortaleza
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623709
    m_Localized: El dado muestra su valor maximo y participa en combo, genera 2 puntos
      de escudo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623710
    m_Localized: "Fr\xE1gil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623711
    m_Localized: 50% de chance de que el dado no cuente para el combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623712
    m_Localized: Gemelo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623713
    m_Localized: Si este dado muestra el mismo numero que otro en la tirada, ambos
      valen x1.5 para el combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623714
    m_Localized: Greed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623715
    m_Localized: If the dice is not in a combo, win 2 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623716
    m_Localized: Impar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623717
    m_Localized: Solo muestra caras impares. d6:{1,3,5} d8:{1,3,5,7} d12:{1,3,5,7,9,11}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623718
    m_Localized: Invertido
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623719
    m_Localized: El resultado es maximo+1 menos resultado. Un d6 que saca 1 cuenta
      como 6.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623720
    m_Localized: Lento
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623721
    m_Localized: Este dado no se puede holdear entre rolls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623722
    m_Localized: Mercader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623723
    m_Localized: Otorga 5 de oro al completar una escalera.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623724
    m_Localized: "Mim\xE9tico"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623725
    m_Localized: Copia el resultado del ultimo dado rerolled en esta tirada para
      propositos de combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623726
    m_Localized: Mitad Inferior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623727
    m_Localized: Solo muestra la mitad inferior del dado. d6:{1,2,3} d8:{1,2,3,4}
      d12:{1,2,3,4,5,6}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623728
    m_Localized: Mitad Superior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623729
    m_Localized: Solo muestra la mitad superior del dado. d6:{4,5,6} d8:{5,6,7,8}
      d12:{7,8,9,10,11,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623730
    m_Localized: Multiplo de 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623731
    m_Localized: Solo muestra multiplos de 3. d12:{3,6,9,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623732
    m_Localized: No Primo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623733
    m_Localized: Solo muestra numeros no primos (incluye el 1). d8:{1,4,6,8}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623734
    m_Localized: Only Evens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531895623735
    m_Localized: This Dice only rolls Even numbers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817984
    m_Localized: Oxidado
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817985
    m_Localized: El dado pierde 1 de su resultado final (minimo 1).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817986
    m_Localized: Par
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817987
    m_Localized: Solo muestra caras pares. d6:{2,4,6} d8:{2,4,6,8} d12:{2,4,6,8,10,12}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817988
    m_Localized: Parity Gamble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817989
    m_Localized: If this dice rolls an Odd number multiplies x3, if not x0
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817990
    m_Localized: Pesado
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817991
    m_Localized: Suma +2 al resultado final del dado.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817992
    m_Localized: Primo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817993
    m_Localized: Solo muestra numeros primos. d12:{2,3,5,7,11}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817994
    m_Localized: Resonante
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817995
    m_Localized: Si 2+ dados muestran el mismo numero en la tirada final, este dado
      suma su valor dos veces al combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817996
    m_Localized: Sediento
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817997
    m_Localized: Cada vez que participa en combo consume 2 de oro. Sin oro no puede
      participar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817998
    m_Localized: Torpe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899817999
    m_Localized: Fuerza un reroll completo en el turno 2 del combate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899818000
    m_Localized: Volatil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531899818001
    m_Localized: Al sacar el maximo el resultado se duplica. Al sacar el minimo vale
      0.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
