  - m_Id: 1211498464378880
    m_Localized: Warrior's Fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211498485350400
    m_Localized: When your health is 3 or less, your base damage increases by 5 points.
      Healing above that threshold returns it to normal.
